    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**** BER PENDING ****\r\n\r\nMagnificent opportunity to acquire this large modern three bed semi-detached home on an elevated position in this convenient and sought after and popular residential location off Blarney Road on the North Side of Cork City and conveniently located to all local amenities in the area and yet only a short stroll to Cork City Centre.\r\n\r\nThe property itself is in excellent condition throughout with well-proportioned, bright spacious rooms, off-street parking to front elevation and large private enclosed garden and patio area to the rear. \r\n\r\nThis property will make an excellent home for the next homeowners.\r\n\r\nGUIDE PRICE €420,000\r\n\r\nSERVICES:\r\nGas Heating\r\nPVC Windows\r\n\r\nBER PENDING\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: - Note the above particulars are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through this firm.  Every care has been taken in their preparation, but we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies. All reasonable offers will be submitted to the owners for consideration."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION COMPRISES;\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nReception Hall; 16’ x 4’7\r\n1 Light, Double Radiator, Laminate floor. \r\n\r\nGuest WC 7’4 x 2’8.\r\n1 Light, 1 Window. WC + WHB. Tile floor.\r\n\r\nLiving room; 16’4 x 11’10\r\n5 Power Points, 1 Light, Bay Window, TV Point, 1 Radiator. 1 Fireplace, Gas/fire. Double doors to reception hall. Laminate floor.\r\n\r\nFamily Room; 12’5 x 10’6’ \r\n4 Power Points, 1 Light. \r\nPatio door leading to patio area. 1 Radiator. Laminate floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room; 18’5 x 9’2\r\n9 Power Points, 2 Lights, 1 Window. Double Radiator.\r\nModern shaker style wall and floor kitchen units, cooker hood, plumbed for integrated dishwasher. Laminate and tile floor.\r\n\r\nUtility; 5’2 x 4’4\r\nPlumbed for Washing Machine and Dryer.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Light. 1 Window. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLarge bright landing area.\r\n1 Light, 1 Window, Hot Press, Carpet Floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master Bedroom); 16’8 x 12’10\r\nBuilt in Robes, 1 Radiator, Carpet Floor.\r\nFull ensuite, white suite, fully tiled walls and floors. \r\n1 Light, 1 Window, 4 Power Points.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2; 12’5 x 10’2\r\nBuilt in Robes, Carpet Floor.\r\n3 Power Points, 1 Light, 1 Window, 1 Radiator. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3; 9’2 x 8’6\r\nBuilt in Robes, Carpet Floor.\r\n3 Power points, 1 Light, 1 Window, 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom; 7’2 x 6’8\r\nThree Piece White Suite, Power Shower and Bath.\r\nFully Tiled Floor and Walls.\r\n1 Light, 1 Window, 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nPatio Area to Rear. Private Raised Enclosed Rear Garden.\r\n\r\nBarna Garden Shed 8’6 x 6’2.\r\n\r\nExtra Wide Side Entrance to Rear Garden."
      },
